source=source.replace('Equal-budget controls reveal angular-sampling effects and no statistically resolved benefit of the tested two-load allocation.','Equal-budget controls reveal angular-sampling effects and no statistically resolved benefit of the tested two-load allocation. Same-operator restricted fits across four compliance formulations preserve the distinction between marginal and deeper support.',1)
